I also created a simple Bash script to check whether a website is responding.

#!/bin/bash

URL="https://www.google.com"

echo "checking website: $URL"

#Send request to website, get it's HTTP status code and save that code it into a variable called STATUS.

STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" "$URL")

echo "HTTP Status: $STATUS"

if [ $STATUS -eq 200 ];
then
	echo "Website is working"
else
	echo "Website may be down or unavailable"
fi
